  m_text: "At Center Peak, you can enjoy our exceptional skiing and paragliding experiences!
    Hit the slopes with a set of skis and poles, or launch off the mountain summit
    in a parachute! \nWe offer a helicopter transport service to and from the mountain
    peak. Detailed instructions on the experience can be found next to the mountain
    center once you arrive."
